  Content: "\u201CWeaving the Midnight Sun\u201D\nNorthern Fibres Guild\nWeaving
    the Midnight Sun celebrates Yukon fibre artists through traditional and contemporary
    textile works that reflect the North\u2019s light, land, and the enduring strength
    of community handcraft.\n"
  RavenSucessScript: "\u201CThreads of light and land! You\u2019ve witnessed fibre
    alchemy. Let\u2019s keep spinning this yarn.\u201D"
  RavenHintScript: "\u201CStamp not showing? Double-check you scanned the right shiny
    square!\u201D"
